{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2022-01-11 09:05:00', 'title': 'BOEING SELECTS COLLINS AEROSPACE ELECTRIC POWER GENERATION SYSTEM FOR B-52', 'text': "ROCKFORD, ILL., JAN. 11, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AS PART OF THE U.S. AIR FORCE'S ONGOING MODERNIZATION EFFORTS TO KEEP THE B-52 BOMBER FLYING INTO THE 2050S, BOEING HAS SELECTED COLLINS AEROSPACE, A RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX) COMPANY, TO UPGRADE THE AIRCRAFT WITH A NEW ELECTRIC POWER GENERATION SYSTEM (EPGS)."}